msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_draft_completed_shipments"
msgid ""
"The following shipments are completed: %(shipments)s. Returning the sales to "
"draft will delete their stock moves and delete any shipments left empty, "
"reversing their stock effects. If the goods have already been delivered, "
"cancel this action."
msgstr ""
"Els albarans següents estan finalitzats: %(shipments)s. Tornar les vendes a "
"esborrany eliminarà els seus moviments d'estoc i els albarans que quedin buits, "
"i revertirà el seu efecte sobre les existències. Si la mercaderia ja s'ha "
"entregat, cancel·leu aquesta acció."
